DESCRIPTION:Dear All\,\n\nThis meeting will serve as the official launch of
	 the 6th AIAA High Lift Prediction Workshop. We’ll introduce our Technic
	al Focus Groups and Leaders\, touch on some of the unanswered questions fr
	om the previous workshops\, and share the test cases we’ll be working on
	. The workshop is scheduled to take place at AIAA Aviation in June 2027\, 
	but work within the focus groups will start in the very near term. This wi
	ll give us around 18 months to work in the focus groups towards answering 
	key questions.\n\n \n\nWe’ve also launched a new website at: https://aia
	a-hlpw.org/  -- More information will be populated there when it becomes a
	vailable. The presentation from this kickoff will be posted here\, if you
	’re unable to join in real time.\n\n \n\nPlease feel free to forward thi
	s invitation to others that may not have been on the distribution list\, o
	r reach out with any other questions or concerns\n\n \n\nWe look forward t
	o your participation!\n\nAdam Clark & Li Wang\n\n_________________________
	_______________________________________________________\n\nMicrosoft Teams
	 Need help? <https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-US>  \n\nJoin the mee
	ting now <https://gov.teams.microsoft.us/l/meetup-join/19%3agcch%3ameeting
	_e928084201904902b18c4edc26592a9d%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22
	bcf48bba-4d6f-4dee-a0d2-7df59cc36629%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22baa51ec4-8028-44d
	c-8e74-e4532a7164bd%22%7d>  \n\nMeeting ID: 992 798 235 537 \n\nPasscode: 
	CK9Jp3tN \n\n________________________________\n\nDial in by phone \n\n+1 2
	06-655-7000\,\,635009239# <tel:+12066557000\,\,635009239>  United States\,
	 Seattle \n\n(888) 359-8755\,\,635009239# <tel:8883598755\,\,635009239>  (
	Toll-free) \n\nFind a local number <https://dialin.cpc.gov.teams.microsoft
	.us/109f9590-3343-471c-a60d-cff7b148466c?id=635009239>  \n\nPhone conferen
	ce ID: 635 009 239# \n\nJoin on a video conferencing device \n\nTenant key
	: teams@pexip.boeing.com <mailto:teams@pexip.boeing.com>  \n\nVideo ID: 51
	4 409 714 2 \n\nMore info <https://pexpedge01.pexip.boeing.com/teams/?conf
